    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just about me feeling bad. it's about them. every time i mess up, the legacy cracks a little more. it's like i'm actively taking away from what they worked so hard to build. if i could just... stop being the problem, wouldn't that be better for everyone? wouldn't the family be better off if the rot was just gone?",
